    "note": "All seven before-strings verified verbatim at the cited locations; all seven after-strings preserve technical meaning with no new padding or caveats. (1) backprop-and-optimization.md:45 — dropping the 分水渠 qualifier leaves the self-contained example $a=2\\theta,p=3a,q=a,s=p+q$ intact; the general rule at line 43 already carries the setup. (2) losses.md:94 — 设两份预报给出的概率分别为 $p=0.2$ 与 $p=0.01$ keeps both numbers and the loss conclusions unchanged. (3) neural-network-basics.md:52 — deleting the 田地图 sentence is safe: nothing later depends on the coordinate-direction note; the XOR table and the $s=x_1+x_2$ band argument are purely algebraic. (4) neural-network-basics.md:106 — 条带 is the body's own term (used again at line 117). (5) neural-network-basics.md:117 — $y=1$ 两点 $s=1$、$y=0$ 两点 $s=0$ 和 2 matches the truth table; 这两条平行直线 has its antecedent in the preceding sentence; 围栏/通道 uniformly become 条带. (6) network-composition.md:46 — identity statement and the post-addition caveat sentence both survive; the ReLU example is untouched. (7) reinforcement-learning.md:48 — rewards $(6,-8)$/$(2,2)$, $\\gamma=0.9$, and both computed returns verified arithmetically ($6-7.2=-1.2$, $2+1.8=3.8$); neutral path naming, expectation conclusion intact. Spot-check beyond the seven sites in the four affected files found no other body-text callbacks to old stories outside the replaceable ???quote blocks (remaining 通道 hits are legitimate channel terminology). The two unchangedChecked claims are accepted as stated."
